    skos:altLabel "AMS"@en ;
    skos:definition "Mass spectrometry technique in which atoms and molecules from a sample are ionized, accelerated to mega-electron volt (\\(\\pu{1 MeV} = \\pu{1.602176634E-13 J}\\)) energies, and separated according to their momentum, charge, and energy, allowing high discrimination for the measurement of nuclide abundances."@en ;
